# Per-machine settings for Home Manager activation steps (nix/home/tools.nix).
# Copy to overrides/vars.env. One KEY=value per line; the last match wins;
# a leading ~ means $HOME. Keys and defaults: Documentation/machine-overrides.md.

# Clone path for github.com/BoscoDomingo/utils (default ~/repos/utils).
# Work devices: keep personal repos apart from work repos under ~/repos.
# ~/repos/personal gets the personal git/jj identity only with the nested rules
# (.gitconfig includeIf, overrides/jj/zz-repos-personal.toml); see the docs.
UTILS_DIR=~/repos/personal/utils
